{"product_id":"migrant-domestic-workers-in-the-middle-east","title":"Migrant domestic workers in the Middle East","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor over half a century, the Middle East has been major migration corridor for domestic workers from Asia and Africa. This book Illuminates the multidimensionality of these workers' lives as they engage in finding a balance between acting and being acted upon, struggle and accommodation, and movement and stasis. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Bina Fernandez \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781137482105 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 207\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44997301141657,"sku":"6RA9781137482105","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c7bf7371644cbefae347c074e4fa7546.jpg?v=1733590536","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/migrant-domestic-workers-in-the-middle-east","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}